
tenant-agent CLI

Tenant infrastructure agent for SMS

Usage: tenant-agent [options] [command]

Commands:
  status       Show tenant agent status and heartbeat
  sync         Sync tenant events with system
  migrate      Run outbox database migrations
  backup       Backup tenant outbox database
  restore      Restore tenant outbox database from a backup file
  clean-db     Delete the local tenant outbox database safely
  export-events Export local outbox events to a JSON file
  import-events Import events from a JSON file into local outbox
  start        Start the Tenant Agent (heartbeat + local_event sync + outbox flush)
  test-sync    Send a test event to the system API
  doctor       Run health checks on tenant agent
  outbox       List all events in the persistent outbox
  flush-outbox Flush all unsent events from outbox to the system API
  retry-unsent Retry sending all unsent events from the outbox
  heartbeat-status Check the last heartbeat status for this tenant

Options:
  -V, --version        output the version number
  -h, --help           display help for command

